NNAAMMEE
       pambrighten - change a PPM image's Saturation and Value


SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       ppaammbbrriigghhtteenn                       [--ssaattuurraattiioonn==[++|--]_s_a_t_u_r_a_t_i_o_n___p_e_r_c_e_n_t]
       [--vvaalluuee==[++|--]_v_a_l_u_e___p_e_r_c_e_n_t] [_n_e_t_p_b_m_f_i_l_e]

       Minimum unique abbreviation of option is acceptable.  You may use  dou‐
